{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22692","headline":"病中哭金銮子 · 白居易","name":"病中哭金銮子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂料吾方病，飜悲汝不全。\n卧惊从枕上，扶哭就灯前。\n有女诚爲累，无儿岂免怜。\n病来才十日，养得已三年。\n慈泪随声迸，悲肠遇物牵。\n故衣犹架上，残药尚头边。\n送出深村巷，看封小墓田。\n莫言三里地，此别是终天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}